WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.100
Our vision hinges on the introduction and implementation

00:04.100 --> 00:07.420
of a 24-hour economy,

00:07.420 --> 00:11.880
which will also be anchored in agriculture and agribusiness.

00:11.880 --> 00:15.520
This innovative approach would unlock potentials that have

00:15.520 --> 00:19.400
long remained dormant, enabling us to harness the energy

00:19.400 --> 00:22.380
and creativity of all our people,

00:22.380 --> 00:26.320
and young people including entrepreneurs can find opportunities

00:26.320 --> 00:29.800
regardless of traditional institutions.

00:29.800 --> 00:32.400
The 24-hour economy model

00:32.400 --> 00:36.560
will also bolster job creation for the young people,

00:36.560 --> 00:40.400
stimulate local industry, and attract foreign investments,

00:40.400 --> 00:43.760
and allow us to build resilient communities

00:43.760 --> 00:46.540
and a sustainable future.

00:46.540 --> 00:49.120
This vision extends

00:49.120 --> 00:52.480
beyond mere economic transactions.

00:52.480 --> 00:54.800
It symbolizes empowerment,

00:54.800 --> 00:57.900
the empowerment of every Ghanaian

00:57.900 --> 01:00.800
to contribute to our national progress.

01:00.800 --> 01:04.600
[music]

01:04.600 --> 01:07.500
To the business leaders and entrepreneurs,

01:07.500 --> 01:10.520
I invite you to support this new model

01:10.520 --> 01:14.360
and join me in shaping a business environment

01:14.360 --> 01:18.280
where creativity thrives and where the fruits of your investments

01:18.280 --> 01:22.420
contribute to the collective welfare of our nation.

01:22.420 --> 01:26.660
Your role in driving our economy forward cannot be overstated.

01:26.660 --> 01:30.980
Your innovation and dedication will be a backbone of our success story.

01:30.980 --> 01:34.020
And I pledge to you that we would

01:34.020 --> 01:37.420
look at the tax regime and rationalize them

01:37.420 --> 01:42.200
so that they're more transparent and fair.

01:42.200 --> 01:46.100
Members of the business community, I assure you

01:46.100 --> 01:49.700
Ghana is open for business again.

01:49.700 --> 01:54.000
I thank you, and welcome you to Ghana,

01:54.000 --> 01:57.740
and in our local parlance, I say

01:57.740 --> 02:01.320
Akwaaba to all of you.

02:01.320 --> 02:11.233
[music]
